{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"真值"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"真值"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在经典逻辑中, 真值只有两个: $\\top$ (真), $\\bot$ (假).</li>\n<li>在"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"中, 真值是"},{"Local":{"url":"子终对象","text":"子终对象"}},{"Plain":", 即终对象 $1$ 的子对象.</li>\n<li>在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, 真值是 $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"类型. 见"},{"Local":{"url":"命题(同伦类型论)","text":"命题 (同伦类型论)"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}